                            {
                                "id": "0,1,0,0",
                                "type": 4,
                                "elements": "The yield to maturity calculator calculates the total annual yield of a bond if you purchase it at the current price, hold it until maturity, and reinvest all coupon payments at the same rate. Change the parameters, and the result will be recalculated.",
